      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那之后我们就开始吃章鱼先生了！　经过我俩的不懈努力，\r\n最后发现了两只螃蟹先生，愉快地一人分了一只♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b86e38b67e139ee0064186d82096443e0c7dbce5a8f9f405c054e60ad0f38a18",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
