      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "休息日，我想着出门散步去呼吸一下外面的空气，\r\n在公园里遇到了待兼诗歌剧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c7f1d263a238ce828609f72f88de0a937e273f78a6c17b1f6dffdfb4cee903a",
